Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:08.23,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Now then, what should I make tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:11.86,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I know Mana said she wanted to eat curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:48.34,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,What on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:50.74,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:06.02,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Was that actually a spatial quake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:53.49,Main - Top + Italics,Speaker,0,0,0,,All citizens, please remain indoors \Nuntil instructed otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:56.37,Main - Top + Italics,Speaker,0,0,0,,Also, airwaves are being overloaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:02:59.57,Main - Top + Italics,Speaker,0,0,0,,so please do your part \Nby refraining from using phones
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:03:02.16,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Big Brother! I'm so glad to see you... safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:01.08,Main - Top + Italics,Speaker,0,0,0,,and other communication devices
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:02.16,Main - Top + Italics,Speaker,0,0,0,,as much as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:04.21,Main - Top + Italics,Speaker,0,0,0,,We ask that you please remain calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.16,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.44,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mana?! Well, you see, this is—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:13.28,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'm on your side, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:16.06,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Let's take our time to repent \Nfor the sins you've committed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:18.14,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Nothing you're assuming is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.26,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,I understand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:22.62,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:25.26,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,That didn't mean you had to \Nbring her to our place!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.80,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,What else could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:31.13,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,The city's in a panic, \Nand she won't say anything to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:33.27,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,so I had no idea what I should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.15,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:38.23,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,For starters, let's have her wear my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.65,0:03:40.67,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,I'll go get some right now, so—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.24,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:55.63,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(316,280)\fs12\3c&H6FD4D9&\c&H105459&\shad0}Danger Do Not Cross
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:03.01,Sign_Basic,BookBottomleft,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs18\c&H96AEB2&\3c&H1C1B22&\shad0\b1\frx32\fry348\frz8.836\an1\pos(0,316)}Fafner\Nin the Azure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:03.01,Sign_Basic,BookBottomCenter,0,0,0,,{\fay-.8\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HA2C3CC&\c&H54646E&\shad0\fs16\an1\frz121.9\frx26\fry348\pos(377.333,305.332)}History and Economics
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:04.25,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:07.51,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I mostly have the language system down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:10.02,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:12.88,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,What do you mean? You just—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:17.76,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,"Ah" and "Unh" were all \Nyou could say yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:20.03,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,and now you're suddenly speaking fluently,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:22.10,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,so of course we'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.10,0:04:24.96,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,You're using more proper Japanese than Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:25.53,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Hmm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:32.33,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Big Brother, I think you might be saying \Nonly "ah" and "unh" for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:33.96,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Wait! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.35,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I love how unique you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:38.00,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,So long as you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:44.01,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,By the way, I'd like to ask, \Nbut who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:47.14,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,You're clearly not a normal person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:51.22,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Does yesterday's spatial quake \Nhave any connection to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:54.39,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:59.37,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like she's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:02.51,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Then could you tell us \Nwhat you do know at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:05.53,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Um, I'd like to know more about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:08.15,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,What I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.15,0:05:13.11,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,is a vast horizon following some kind of \Nexplosion like the one from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.04,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,There were three people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:19.98,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Two young men and one little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:21.85,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Three people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:24.36,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Following an explosion like yesterday's?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:27.18,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,You were there at \Nthe Great Eurasian Spatial Quake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.21,0:05:32.38,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:36.33,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I just felt a little pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:39.19,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I see. Please don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:42.69,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:44.82,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.78,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,So, Big Brother, what are you \Nplanning to do with this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:52.37,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,What will I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:53.26,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,The police should—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:54.44,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,N-No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:57.64,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Both hospitals and the police \Nare busy after yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:06:00.46,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,If we just tossed her into their care \Nwithout warning, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.06,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:06.61,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,I guess we'll just wait and see \Nfor now while she stays with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:09.09,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like she's a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:13.60,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You're going to let me stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:14.68,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.74,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Since our father and mother \Naren't here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:19.64,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:22.74,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,That reminds me, we haven't \Nintroduced ourselves, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:25.11,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Neither of us have shared our names.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:26.72,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Names?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.41,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm Shinji Takamiya,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.76,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,and this is my little sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.57,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Mana Takamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.57,0:06:35.33,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shinji and Mana Takamiya...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:37.38,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,So, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.75,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,You do have a name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:44.47,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,My name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:49.48,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Uh, you don't need to force \Nyourself to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:52.69,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Your memories might naturally \Ncome back on their own in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:55.81,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,But it's inconvenient \Nif she doesn't have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:58.02,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,We need something to call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.30,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,In that case, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:03.40,Main,Calendar,0,0,0,,{\c&HB5BABD&\pos(306.667,152.667)\fs8\shad0\3c&HFCFFFD&\b1\bord1}May
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:05.77,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I know, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:07.09,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:10.28,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio, written with zero and \Nthe water radical to make waterway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:13.00,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.28,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,By the way, how did you come up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:18.48,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Well, yesterday was May 30th, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:21.14,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,So 3-0 can be read as Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:25.43,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:28.41,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Still, we have public \Nappearances to worry about,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:31.46,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,so for a while we'll say \Nyou're a family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:35.55,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Meaning your full name will be Mio Takamiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:38.71,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Mio Takamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:45.62,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.95,0:07:47.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:50.46,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm happy, so why am I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:52.57,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:03.33,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Hey, Ike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:06.30,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Do you really think she's in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:09.59,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,She might have run away \Nsomewhere else already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:13.37,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I just hope she's safe at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.57,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.37,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I finally nabbed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.58,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Here you go, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:43.69,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:46.58,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You're giving it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:48.92,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,That's why I nabbed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.17,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Or did you not want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:55.09,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,You kept looking at it during our walk, \Nso I assumed you love stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:57.07,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.11,0:08:59.20,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.27,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,To view something favorably...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:04.73,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,To be drawn to something \Nwith strong interest...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:06.84,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:09.25,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure this is love!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:13.11,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:19.62,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Uh, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:21.79,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,If you'd like, would you go on a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:24.70,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,d-date with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:29.22,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I should practice a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:31.73,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,G-Good morning, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:32.97,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Nice weather we're having, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:34.63,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Want to go out for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:36.35,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,No, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:39.69,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,We go shopping together all the time anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:41.64,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I want it to be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:43.14,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,A real date.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:46.27,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I want Mio to think of it as a date, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.69,0:09:48.41,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Uh, ahem, ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:51.69,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio, let's go on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:52.39,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:54.36,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,M-Mio?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:56.43,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah? What's the matter, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:58.66,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,H-How long have you been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.07,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Since you said, "No, that's not right."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.53,0:10:05.58,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So, Shin, when are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.79,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Huh? G-Going on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:10.29,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,On our date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:12.54,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,A date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:13.37,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.91,0:10:16.17,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Y-You're going on a date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.17,0:10:20.46,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,My shy, unsociable big brother \Nasked you out on a date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:24.83,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:27.17,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Though thinking about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:31.02,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,a date is just a man and woman \Nmeeting up together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.07,0:10:34.79,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm with Shin every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:40.57,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,so I'm not really sure what it means to \Ngo out together in a more formal sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:43.05,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Well, in short it means big brother
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:46.20,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,wants to grow even closer to you, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:49.94,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,You could say he's trying to \Nshow you his affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:52.96,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.06,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:58.29,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin feels affection toward me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.97,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:05.47,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:07.61,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:10.35,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,In that case, let's get you prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:13.20,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,I heard what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:16.11,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,I'm Haruko Homura, Mana's BFF!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:18.68,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:20.14,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,BFF?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:24.37,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not in the dictionary, \Nso don't worry about the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:28.42,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Haruko knows a lot about fashion, \Nso I called her in to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:32.37,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,I know you told me before, \Nbut she really is a pretty woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:37.20,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,Who's the lucky boy who's \Ngetting to date such a beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:39.38,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Well, my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:39.92,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:42.26,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,For real?! Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:44.90,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,All right, I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:48.01,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,This is going to be well worth it \Nin all kinds of ways!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:51.64,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,First, I need to equip my focus enhancing item!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.90,Main,Haruko,0,0,0,,Now which should we go with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:12:01.53,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:08.37,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:22.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,What's the matter? You had a scary look...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:24.88,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:26.90,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Did I look that scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.29,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.29,0:12:30.59,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You looked like you were \Ngoing off to war or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:33.01,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,War, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:37.05,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:40.94,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,It's just... y-you're way too cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:49.69,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,W-Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:52.27,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.69,0:12:55.46,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:59.15,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shall we start our date?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:09.94,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,The ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:12.74,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,You said you wanted to see it \Nsomeday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:14.14,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:15.81,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:19.11,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm glad that you're enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:24.61,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:26.56,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.61,0:13:28.56,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:29.87,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,The hem of your skirt is—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:31.62,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:38.00,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:42.13,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:57.56,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,M-Mio?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:15.58,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:33.53,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,What are we doing for dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:35.21,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I haven't decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:37.48,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Is there anything you'd like to eat, Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:40.85,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm happy with any food you make, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:45.23,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:54.62,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:57.62,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio! What's gotten into you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:59.25,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll explain later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:00.53,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:14.89,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Who are you people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:18.27,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin, grab on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:19.17,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:28.86,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:31.61,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'm all right. We need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:41.82,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Show me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:56.85,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:58.15,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:15:59.55,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.85,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Who on earth were those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:12.68,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,They're probably after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:13.58,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:15.34,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I've started to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:19.53,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,When I first woke up that man \Nfrom before was in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:22.74,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Then he tried to capture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:25.53,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:28.61,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's my fault you've gotten wrapped up in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:30.26,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:31.25,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.35,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:38.01,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I was ready to face some trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.77,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,from the moment I took in a girl \Nwith mysterious powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:46.42,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,We're family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:54.39,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's slip out to where \Nthere are lots of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:55.91,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Then we'll go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:58.53,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate the rule of law!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:04.41,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.74,0:17:05.70,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:07.67,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:10.83,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Hey now, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:14.42,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Why would you to come to me of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:15.61,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.79,0:17:19.10,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Hmm, so is Mio that woman's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:21.06,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Yeah, I gave it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:24.23,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I see. It's a good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:27.06,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Hey, are you happy right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:32.94,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,At the very least, I don't enjoy being \Nchased around by people hostile to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:36.34,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,No, I'm not referring to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:38.70,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I was talking about being \Nwith that guy beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:43.65,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:48.33,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Then scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:50.84,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:53.68,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,There's nothing else to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:55.26,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Hurry up and go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.75,0:18:03.15,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Boy... Take care of that girl, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:15.81,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:17.70,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:22.75,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's my first time meeting that boy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.39,0:18:27.30,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking care of our Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:29.21,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I truly am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:30.32,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:32.63,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,We have your little sister in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:37.26,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Now, why don't we return \Nboth women to where they belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.37,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:39.85,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Just try doing anything to Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.14,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you if you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:45.10,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Oh? Her name is Mana, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.18,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,That's quite the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:51.62,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I can understand why our Spirit \Nwould wind up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:18:56.47,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.70,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,If I go with you, then you'll return Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:03.95,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Yes, of course we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.65,0:19:05.58,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:06.72,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:09.96,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I was never supposed to exist here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:14.71,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Even spending a short time \Nwith you made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:27.72,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:30.25,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:32.85,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin! What are you—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:33.94,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:36.13,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Do you really think he'll keep his promise?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:40.78,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,What guarantee do we have that he won't \Njust kill me and Mana once we has you, Mio?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:45.37,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,So as long as you're with us, \Nthey can't lay a hand on Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:48.69,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,So it would be way better to stay \Nwith me and shore up our position!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.89,0:20:02.95,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.43,0:20:04.43,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:08.68,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I wasn't actually lying, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:09.69,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.53,0:20:14.31,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mi...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:21.15,Main,Shinji,0,0,0,,o...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.07,0:21:17.67,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:20.17,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I can just recreate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.33,0:21:42.15,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll never let go of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:45.45,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I won't make any more mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.75,0:21:47.70,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.13,0:21:52.70,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,wait for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:53.93,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:54.96,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:54.96,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}The Spirit's Resurrection
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:39.98,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs18\pos(604,310)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 5 "Mother Mio"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:28.86,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Mio Takamiya, \Nthe mother of all Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.86,0:23:30.09,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,As the battle rages on,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.09,0:23:31.66,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,some confront their most beloved
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.66,0:23:33.97,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,and others confront their hated enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:36.81,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next episode is Episode 5: "Mother Mio."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.81,0:23:39.69,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,The blossoms of death bloom in the sky.
